  clock: 5  # 20da
  nonce: 20da  # 20da
  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0037, merged in PR #4181): is_resolved is redefined as 'dst is a real in-repo node' — external_symbol placeholders are by definition not in-repo, so the overloaded meaning this item documents is replaced by an explicit contract enforced by an FK validator check. The 'unresolved' node kind folds into 'external_symbol'. Waits on the implementation and doc update."  # 20da
