- op: discuss  # da53
  at: '2026-06-17T01:52:48Z'  # da53
  by: agent  # da53
  actor: jgstern_agent  # da53
  clock: 7  # da53
  nonce: da53  # da53
  message: "Closed by ADR-0037 ruling 1 (PR merged selfh/dev 2dd851297d). The empirical semantic WI-ninuv documented — is_resolved=False does NOT mean dst-absent; all unresolved dsts exist as materialized external_symbol placeholders (present-but-synthetic) — is now the DOCUMENTED contract. Edge.is_resolved docstring (ir.py) rewritten: 'Whether dst is a real, in-repo (first-party) symbol node present in the graph … External/stdlib targets are materialized as external_symbol placeholder nodes and are always is_resolved=False even though the dst node exists (present-but-synthetic, not absent).' ADR-0037 §Implementation-status records the same. Documentation fix per the ADR disposition table."  # da53
